Package: MRManalyzeR
Type: Package
Title: Process and Analyse Targeted LC-MS Lipidomics and Metabolomics Data
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: person("Matthew J.", "Smith",
                  email = "mattyjsmith123@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7357-2670"))
Description: End-to-end processing workflow for targeted lipidomics and
    metabolomics data exported from Waters TargetLynx or from Skyline. Reads
    xlsx workbooks, builds a peak-area / concentration matrix with optional
    signal filtering (SNR, LOD or LOQ), blank filtering, normalisation,
    calibration and internal-standard concentration adjustment, missing-value
    imputation, and batch correction, then renders self-contained HTML data
    quality and statistical reports. Each step is an exported function acting
    on a DatasetExperiment, and a whole run can be driven from a single YAML
    config via run_MRManalyzeR().
